~ start
do CutsceneController.lock_input()
do CutsceneController.set_textbox_color("#4028c4")
do CutsceneController.set_textbox_frame(0)
do CutsceneController.show_textbox()
if not Statics.is_random_game:
	NPC36: Heya, {{Player.player_name}}![wait=0.15]  [color=#ffb23d]Gravity Shock[/color] upgrades your [color=#4bd867]gravity jump[/color]![wait=0.25]  Pretty neat, huh?
	NPC36: While in the air,[wait=0.2] {{GlobalText.COL_CTRL}}gravity jump in the direction you're falling[/color] to unleash a powerful attack!!
else:
	NPC36: I don't get many visitors out here.[wait=0.25]  Admittedly, it gets kinda lonely.[wait=0.3]  Thanks for stopping by.
=> END